    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIS GAME IS A WORK IN PROGRESS<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/c65434c9e7bcb46374db12ea4a546677.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the captain of a pirate ship and collect the cards of crew, weapons and magical loot in this fantastical naval combat deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/4a000a592ab9c5a8dabbdfcbab24e6e2.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick travel on procedurally generated map routes or break off to avoid a tough battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/a859da5cb14524fd1e6f81d7ec6b8721.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.poster.avif?t=1726845157\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.webm?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.mp4?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoom in and take the helm to skillfully sail in a beautiful stylized world and command directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/836d1942590d771c6b16adbda81803e3.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/69c37bba4a3d3d038a9c557d3b0dddb7.poster.avif?t=1726845157\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/69c37bba4a3d3d038a9c557d3b0dddb7.webm?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/69c37bba4a3d3d038a9c557d3b0dddb7.mp4?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raid and plunder with your crew in realtime card combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/2c71c6aaba84ed709e21e718995cc130.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/8f90f105e06e45fca0c81bd02fe8e338.poster.avif?t=1726845157\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/8f90f105e06e45fca0c81bd02fe8e338.webm?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/8f90f105e06e45fca0c81bd02fe8e338.mp4?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIS GAME IS A WORK IN PROGRESS<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/c65434c9e7bcb46374db12ea4a546677.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the captain of a pirate ship and collect the cards of crew, weapons and magical loot in this fantastical naval combat deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/4a000a592ab9c5a8dabbdfcbab24e6e2.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick travel on procedurally generated map routes or break off to avoid a tough battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/a859da5cb14524fd1e6f81d7ec6b8721.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.poster.avif?t=1726845157\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.webm?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.mp4?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoom in and take the helm to skillfully sail in a beautiful stylized world and command directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/836d1942590d771c6b16adbda81803e3.avif?t=1726845157\" /></div><